      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PrimaSolusi Email Automation\n\n## Flow Overview\n1. Gmail Trigger → tangkap email masuk\n2. Log ke Google Sheets (status: received)\n3. Markdown → convert HTML ke plain text\n4. Summarize email dengan AI\n5. Classify email: kandidat / klien_korporat / spam\n6. Switch Router → pisah branch\n7. Branch A (kandidat): auto-reply + update log\n8. Branch B (klien_korporat): buat draft + notif Slack + update log\n9. Branch C (spam): label Gmail + update log\n\n## Setup yang perlu diisi\n- Gmail credential\n- OpenAI API key\n- Google Sheets ID + Sheet Name\n- Slack credential + Channel ID",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 5
